22.2345275878906, "1": 242.95498657226562}, "pos": [-1612, 349], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["", "The image portrays a character clad in a fiery, action-packed scene with flames engulfing the background. The figure is highly dynamic, exuding power and intensity. Their outfit consists of elaborately designed martial arts-inspired attire, featuring deep red pants adorned with golden accents and intricate embroidery. A golden belt buckle with ornate detailing is prominently visible. The character's torso is bare, revealing muscular physique and tattoos on the chest and arms. They wear striking golden accessories, including a bracelet and a necklace resembling prayer beads, with a glowing pendant at the center. \n\nThe character's hair is wild and spiky, further emphasizing their energetic and defiant nature. A flowing red ribbon tied around their waist or arms adds a sense of motion to the composition. The flames in the background suggest an otherworldly, mythological setting, enhancing the character's aura of supernatural strength. Based on the appearance, this character shares similarities with Nezha, a prominent figure from Chinese mythology and folklore known for their fiery demeanor and rebellious spirit, often depicted as a youthful warrior in such vivid, dramatic styles."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "index": 1, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [426.04736328125, 350.2543640136719], "pos": [-1611, -48], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING"}], "color": "#749975", "widgets_values": ["", "这幅画描绘了一个虚构的神话风格人物，站在一片激烈的火焰背景中。人物佩戴着精致的金色配饰，包括一条显眼的华丽腰带和手镯，与人物的尊贵外观相得益彰。这套服装由传统武术风格的红黑色服装组成，带有金色点缀，散发出英雄和神话的气息。这个角色似乎充满活力，从他狂野的、燃烧的黑红色头发中可以看出，这似乎违背了重力。从服装上飘出的红色腰带为激烈的场景增添了动感。背景被熊熊的火焰吞没，余烬四处飞扬，营造出一种戏剧性和史诗般的氛围。肩膀和胸部的纹身暗示着文化或神秘意义，增强了角色的力量和神秘感。整体美感与亚洲神话人物非常相似，比如哪吒，这是中国民间传说中的传奇战士神，经常被描绘成火热和好战的人物。这幅生动而热烈的描绘代表了无限的能量和不羁的精神，捕捉到了强大而戏剧性的视觉瞬间。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "index": 2, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#608561", "size": [615.7678833007812, 639.199462890625], "pos": [-1140, -35], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 25}], "links": [[null, 0, 0, 0, 31, "IMAGE"], [0, 0, 1, 0, 32, "STRING"], [null, 0, 2, 0, 34, "STRING"]]}, "图像加载": {"external": [[0, 0, "CLIP"], [3, 0, "MODEL"]], "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "CLIP", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP"}], "size": {"0": 306.4404296875, "1": 130}, "pos": [-838, 109], "widgets_values": ["sd3/t5xxl_fp16.safetensors", "sd3/clip_l.safetensors", "flux", "default"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "index": 0, "type": "DualCLIPLoader", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "DualCLIPLoader"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL"}], "size": {"0": 313.051513671875, "1": 82}, "pos": [-1159, 81], "widgets_values": ["flux1-dev-fp8-Kijai.safetensors", "fp8_e4m3fn"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "index": 1, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL"}], "size": {"0": 315.3472900390625, "1": 91.43144226074219}, "pos": [-823, -94], "widgets_values": ["Flux洗图神器.safetensors", 0.4], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL"}], "flags": {}, "index": 2, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs